{"content_hash": "2a03eaecf36c9e06", "version_id": 742, "article_id": 75, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Crowd of 50 kills foreign man in South Africa", "title_zh": "南非约50人围殴一名外国人致死", "has_translation": true, "topic": "world", "source": "bbc_world", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck5yn9z3vnego?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1623438744990-f47414813a29?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Y3Jvd2QlMjBiZWF0cyUyMGZvcmVpZ25lcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkyNzEzOTg0fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Amir Arabshahi on Unsplash", "author": "Amir Arabshahi", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@amir_arabshahi?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-crowd-of-people-with-their-hands-in-the-air-ERSKz8OrZIQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(69, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(107, 46%, 48%)", "label": "WORLD", "seed": "d8d50814b11f"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-23", "word_count": 142, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Police in South Africa say a crowd of about 50 people beat a foreign man to death in Durban. The man died at the scene. Police are still looking for the reason.", "lead_zh": "南非警方说，在德班市，大约50人围殴一名外籍男子，把他打死了。这名男子当场死亡。警方仍在调查原因。", "preview": "Police said the man was in his late 30s or early 40s. They do not know his name yet. Two men first came up to him by the road. Then a bigger", "preview_zh": "警方说，这名男子大约三十七八岁到四十出头。他们还不知道他的名字。先有两名男子在路边走近他，然后一大群人袭击了他。警方已经展开调查。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 730, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 51.45, "size_bytes": 309600, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 52.55, "size_bytes": 316224, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/75/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 56.175, "size_bytes": 337968, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/75/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 47.975, "size_bytes": 288864, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/75/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/75/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 51.65, "size_bytes": 310896, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 165, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/75/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5e0dbb9/content/data/versions/742.json", "paragraphs": ["Police said the man was in his late 30s or early 40s. They do not know his name yet. Two men first came up to him by the road. Then a bigger group attacked him. Police have started an investigation.", "This year, many protests against immigrants have taken place in South Africa. Some turned violent. Earlier this month, people set fire to shops and cars in Durban and in Soweto, near Johannesburg.", "The government asked protesters to stay peaceful. It also says it accepts the need for immigration reform. Since early this year, it has deported or sent home tens of thousands of foreign nationals.", "South Africa has had xenophobic attacks for almost 20 years. In 2008, more than 60 people died in attacks on foreigners. Poverty, inequality and high unemployment are behind the unrest. Migrants are often blamed for taking jobs."], "paragraphs_zh": ["警方说，这名男子大约三十七八岁到四十出头。他们还不知道他的名字。先有两名男子在路边走近他，然后一大群人袭击了他。警方已经展开调查。", "今年，南非发生了很多反对移民的抗议活动。其中一些变成了暴力事件。本月早些时候，有人在德班和约翰内斯堡附近的索韦托放火烧商店和汽车。", "政府要求抗议者保持和平。政府还表示，接受进行移民改革的必要性。自今年年初以来，南非已驱逐或遣返了数万名外籍人士。", "南非近20年来一直发生排外袭击。2008年，60多人在针对外国人的袭击中丧生。贫困、不平等和高失业率是骚乱的根源。移民常常被指责抢走工作。"], "body": "Police said the man was in his late 30s or early 40s. They do not know his name yet. Two men first came up to him by the road. Then a bigger group attacked him. Police have started an investigation.\n\nThis year, many protests against immigrants have taken place in South Africa. Some turned violent. Earlier this month, people set fire to shops and cars in Durban and in Soweto, near Johannesburg.\n\nThe government asked protesters to stay peaceful. It also says it accepts the need for immigration reform. Since early this year, it has deported or sent home tens of thousands of foreign nationals.\n\nSouth Africa has had xenophobic attacks for almost 20 years. In 2008, more than 60 people died in attacks on foreigners. Poverty, inequality and high unemployment are behind the unrest. Migrants are often blamed for taking jobs.", "body_zh": "警方说，这名男子大约三十七八岁到四十出头。他们还不知道他的名字。先有两名男子在路边走近他，然后一大群人袭击了他。警方已经展开调查。\n\n今年，南非发生了很多反对移民的抗议活动。其中一些变成了暴力事件。本月早些时候，有人在德班和约翰内斯堡附近的索韦托放火烧商店和汽车。\n\n政府要求抗议者保持和平。政府还表示，接受进行移民改革的必要性。自今年年初以来，南非已驱逐或遣返了数万名外籍人士。\n\n南非近20年来一直发生排外袭击。2008年，60多人在针对外国人的袭击中丧生。贫困、不平等和高失业率是骚乱的根源。移民常常被指责抢走工作。", "text": "Police said the man was in his late 30s or early 40s. They do not know his name yet. Two men first came up to him by the road. Then a bigger group attacked him. Police have started an investigation. This year, many protests against immigrants have taken place in South Africa. Some turned violent. Earlier this month, people set fire to shops and cars in Durban and in Soweto, near Johannesburg. The government asked protesters to stay peaceful. It also says it accepts the need for immigration reform. Since early this year, it has deported or sent home tens of thousands of foreign nationals. South Africa has had xenophobic attacks for almost 20 years. In 2008, more than 60 people died in attacks on foreigners. Poverty, inequality and high unemployment are behind the unrest. Migrants are often blamed for taking jobs.", "vocab": [{"word": "crowd", "pos": "noun", "zh": "人群", "note": "a crowd of 表示“一群”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "beat to death", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "打死", "note": "beat 的过去式仍是 beat", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "foreign", "pos": "adj", "zh": "外国的", "note": "foreign national 指外籍人士", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "police", "pos": "noun", "zh": "警察", "note": "常用作复数，the police", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "investigation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "调查", "note": "launch an investigation 展开调查", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "protest", "pos": "noun", "zh": "抗议", "note": "动词也是 protest", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "violence", "pos": "noun", "zh": "暴力", "note": "形容词是 violent", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unemployment", "pos": "noun", "zh": "失业", "note": "high unemployment 高失业率", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-23T00:06:23.045368", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Police", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.55, "sm": 250, "em": 550, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "said", "s": 0.55, "e": 0.687, "sm": 550, "em": 687, "cs": 7, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "the", "s": 0.688, "e": 0.775, "sm": 687, "em": 775, "cs": 12, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "man", "s": 0.775, "e": 1.1, "sm": 775, "em": 1100, "cs": 16, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "was", "s": 1.1, "e": 1.25, "sm": 1100, "em": 1249, "cs": 20, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "in", "s": 1.25, "e": 1.337, "sm": 1250, "em": 1337, "cs": 24, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "his", "s": 1.337, "e": 1.5, "sm": 